      "version": "1.0.0-SNAPSHOT",
      "description": "# Portfolio — Design & Development\n\nA modern, responsive personal portfolio built with Bellini-native box/grid layouts and core navigation, links, inputs, and buttons. The visual direction pairs ink, ivory, and teal with built-in font icons and no external imagery.\n\n## Pages\n- **Home:** Hero introduction and featured project concepts.\n- **About:** Approach and strengths.\n- **Projects:** Exactly one Projects gallery, at `/projects`, presenting sample project concepts through reusable cards.\n- **Contact:** Local-only message preview with required-field, length, email-format, and trim-aware validation, plus accessible feedback. Messages are never sent or persisted.\n\n## Reusable components and navigation\n- Reusable app-owned navigation wraps Bellini core navigation. All internal links use Bellini page states.\n- A reusable card validates internal page-state destinations and external destinations.\n\n## Production launch blockers\n- Upload and connect a portrait and project screenshots.\n- Replace sample projects and the generic biography with actual personal and project content.\n- Provide backend/email integration for contact delivery, address anti-spam and privacy requirements, and verify end-to-end delivery before enabling real submissions. The current contact experience is preview-only.\n- Perform browser, mobile, and keyboard QA.\n\nThe app is not yet production-ready. This overview does not claim that browser/mobile/keyboard testing or end-to-end delivery verification has been performed.",
      "title": "Portfolio — Design & Development"
    },
